<title>GERMANY: Heidelberger Zement H1 sales flat.</title>
<headline>Heidelberger Zement H1 sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>HEIDELBERG, Germany</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				 2,876   vs 2,885</p>
<p>    Group investments			 1,100   vs 353</p>
<p>Geographic break-down of group sales:</p>
<p>    Western Europe			    702     vs 709</p>
<p>    West central Europe		     1,076   vs 1,209</p>
<p>    East central Europe		     203     vs 206</p>
<p>    North America			     825     vs 761</p>
<p>Break-down by product:</p>
<p>    Cement					1,473   vs 1,439</p>
<p>    Concrete				    867     vs 806</p>
<p>    Building materials			689     vs 759</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the company is Heidelberger Zement AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
